{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And YHWH said to Aaron.</b> To Moses He said that he should say to Aaron, to caution him concerning the orderly arrangement of Israel — that they not enter the sanctuary." "<b>You and your sons and your father's house.</b> They are the sons of Kohath, father of Amram." "<b>You shall bear the iniquity of the sanctuary.</b> Upon you I impose the punishment of the outsiders who sin in the matters of the consecrated things entrusted to you — that is, the Tent and the Ark and the Table and the sacred vessels. You must sit and caution any outsider who comes to minister." "<b>And you and your sons.</b> The priests." "<b>You shall bear the iniquity of your priesthood.</b> Which is not entrusted to the Levites, and you must caution the Levites who err unwittingly not to come near you in your service."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:29.250487306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}